t nation of China.\nThe China-Ukraine final was a classic. China maintained a clear lead until, with the score 40-36 in favour of the Chinese, the final pairing of " [:a {:href "/athletes/112560"} "Olha Kharlan"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/105973"} "Tan Xue"] " took to the stage. Kharlan, the outstanding performer of the final, fought back to tie the scores at 44-all with all to play for on the final hit. The two fencers appeared to score simultaneously and, after a lengthy video review, it was decided that a decision was impossible and they returned to fight once more. For the second time they appeared to score simultaneous hits but this time the referee decided in favour of the Ukrainian."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Seed"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "5"] [:td {} "Ukraine"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/UKR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/UKR.png"}] "UKR"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "8"} [:a {:href "/athletes/112560"} "Olha Kharlan"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/112555"} "Olena Khomrova"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/112567"} "Halyna Pundyk"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/118143"} "Olha Zhovnir"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "3"] [:td {} "People's Republic of China"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "8"} [:a {:href "/athletes/112553"} "Bao Yingying"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/112565"} "Huang Haiyang"] " • " [:a {:hre